  "data": {
    "body": "Let $\\mathbb{M}_{3 \\times 3}$ be the space of $3 \\times 3$ matrices. Let $H$ be the subspace of $\\mathbb{M}_{3 \\times 3}$ consisting of all matrices $A=\\left[\\begin{array}{lll}a & b & c \\\\ d & e & f \\\\ g & h & i\\end{array}\\right]$ such that $A\\left[\\begin{array}{r}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 0\\end{array}\\right]=\\left[\\begin{array}{l}0 \\\\ 0 \\\\ 0\\end{array}\\right]$. What is the dimension of $H$ ?",
